# Wave T33 (Steamspring kit): steamroof — RUST BARREL-TILE:
# vertical half-round clay tile ridges (a light-crest /
# shadow-flank rhythm) in the town's volcanic rust register,
# a horizontal course shadow where each tile row ends, pale
# mineral-crust flecks from the spring air. Rounded ridge
# relief — unlike Beacon's flat standing-seam metal, Lilac's
# bronze shingle courses, Fairhaven's stitched canvas,
# Mistford's split-shake, Wildflower's open lattice.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T33-STEAMSPRING-PLAN.md §5.)
